  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation EU Global Support Facility for Climate (EU Climate Facility)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: EU Global Support Facility for Climate (EU Climate Facility) - As part of the Green Deal Knowledge Hub, this action will provide high level, demand driven technical assistance and policy advice to support climate action at country, regional and global levels, in line with SDG 13 and the Paris Agreement framework. It will assist partner countries in the preparation, revision, update and implementation of NDCs, NAPs, LTSs and related climate, environment and disaster risk reduction strategies, as well as other climate related, environmental and sectoral strategies and multilateral environmental agreements, in response to specific requests channelled via EU Delegations or relevant headquarters units. The action will strengthen climate related transparency, MRV and data systems, and support partner country readiness for carbon markets and international carbon crediting under Article 6, to enable effective tracking and steering of climate policies and investments.  It will generate and disseminate knowledge, tools and peer learning through the Green Deal Knowledge Hub to enhance climate governance and implementation.  In this context, the action will provide upstream analytical and technical support to integrate climate action into public and private investments, helping to originate, screen and structure Global Gateway  and Team Europe aligned, sustainable, clean and climate resilient infrastructure and other green investments, in coherence with the EU Green Deal.</narrative>
  </description>
